<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS UP AT $44-7/8 (FIM 204.87).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS UP AT $44-7/8 (FIM 204.87).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed up $0-3/4 at $44-7/8 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 204.87 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia closed up 4.50 markka at 202.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed $0-3/8 higher at $32-3/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 74.76 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 1.50 markka at 76.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS closed flat at $21 (95.87 markka) in New York. Rauma ended unchanged in Helsinki as well.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
